#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F_Text_AttackOrDefenseTM"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\p"
"An attacking move…\n"
"Or a defensive move…\p"
"It's no easy matter to decide which TM\n"
"moves should be taught to POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\p"
"攻击招式……\n"
"还是防御招式……\p"
"要教宝可梦哪个招式学习器的招式，\n"
"可真不好决定……$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F/scripts.inc:59
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F_Text_FiftyDifferentTMs"
msgid ""
"There are so many different kinds of\n"
"TM moves.\p"
"A catalog I read said there are fifty\n"
"different kinds.$"
msgstr ""
"招式学习器的招式\n"
"有好多种啊。\p"
"我看过的一本目录上说，\n"
"一共有五十种。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F_Text_PokemonOnlyHaveFourMoves"
msgid ""
"I'd like to get all the different TMs,\n"
"but a POKéMON learns only four moves.$"
msgstr ""
"我想要所有种类的招式学习器，\n"
"可是宝可梦只能学会四个招式。$"
